# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SalaryNet mobile — environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ are exposed to the
# client JS bundle. Do NOT put secrets here — anything inside will
# end up inside the built app.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values you need.
#   cp .env.example .env
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend API base URL.
# If unset, the app auto-detects from the Expo dev server host and
# falls back to localhost (iOS) or 10.0.2.2 (Android emulator).
#
# Examples:
#   Local dev (LAN):   http://192.168.1.10:4000/api/v1
#   Android emulator:  http://10.0.2.2:4000/api/v1
#   iOS simulator:     http://localhost:4000/api/v1
#   Production:        https://api.salarynet.app/api/v1
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
